---
import { url } from '@/data/curriculum';
---
<footer class="site-footer" data-pagefind-ignore>
  <div class="container footer-inner">
    <div class="footer-brand">
      <a class="footer-title" href={url('/')}><span class="logo-ai">AI</span>ology</a>
      <p>그림과 직접 만져 보는 시각화로 배우는 인공지능 교과서. 직선 하나로 배우는 기계에서 시작해 Transformer, 확산 모델, 에이전트까지 다룹니다.</p>
    </div>
    <nav class="footer-links" aria-label="바닥글 메뉴">
      <div>
        <span class="footer-head">배우기</span>
        <a href={url('/book/')}>책 (28장)</a>
        <a href={url('/playground/')}>시각화 실험실</a>
        <a href={url('/map/')}>학습 지도</a>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span class="footer-head">연습하기</span>
        <a href={url('/practice/')}>코드랩 (20개)</a>
        <a href={url('/review/')}>복습 퀴즈</a>
        <a href={url('/glossary/')}>용어 사전</a>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span class="footer-head">이 책에 대해</span>
        <a href={url('/about/')}>소개와 읽는 법</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/llouis0622/AI/issues/new" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">오류 제보</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/llouis0622/AI" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub 저장소</a>
      </div>
    </nav>
  </div>
  <div class="container footer-bottom">
    <span>학습 기록은 이 브라우저에만 저장됩니다.</span>
    <span>© AIology · <a href="https://github.com/llouis0622" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">llouis0622</a></span>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .site-footer {
    margin-top: 96px;
    padding: 48px 0 24px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--bg-2);
  }

  .footer-inner {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 36px;
  }

  .footer-brand {
    max-width: 360px;
  }

  .footer-brand p {
    margin: 10px 0 0;
    color: var(--text-2);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .footer-title {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }

  .logo-ai {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .footer-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 56px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .footer-links div {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .footer-links a {
    color: var(--text-2);
  }

  .footer-links a:hover {
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .footer-head {
    margin-bottom: 2px;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text-3);
  }

  .footer-bottom {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 8px 24px;
    margin-top: 40px;
    padding-top: 18px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--text-3);
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  .footer-bottom a:hover {
    color: var(--text);
  }
</style>
